  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Aid Transparency Initiative (IATI) 2022-23</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The International Aid Transparency Initiative (IATI) is a coalition of donors, developing countries and Non-Government Organisations who are working to make public regular, detailed and timely information on aid programs and results of development expenditure. IATI aims to make information about aid spending easier to access, use and understand. Funding under this initiative represents Australia&apos;s annual contribution to IATI and includes administrative support to participate in the IATI Steering Committee.</narrative>
  </description>
